{"id":8879779348679,"title":"Pamnest Twin Halloween Comforter Set with Sheets, 5 Pieces - Design 05","handle":"pamnest-twin-halloween-comforter-set-with-sheets-5-pieces-design-05","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience ultimate comfort and style with the Jeminise Twin Halloween Comforter Set. This 5-piece bedding ensemble is designed to add a touch of fashion and coziness to your sleeping space, ensuring a peaceful night's sleep with its premium, finely brushed microfiber filling.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Material:\u003c\/strong\u003e Filled with premium, finely brushed microfibers for exceptional softness, lightness, and breathability, ensuring maximum comfort.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e This set includes one comforter (68\" x 90\"), one flat sheet (66\" x 92\"), one fitted sheet (39\" x 80\" x 14\"), one pillowcase (20\" x 30\"), and one pillow sham (20\" x 30\").\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExquisite Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features stylish and exquisite patterns with durable stitching that prevents filling from shifting or clumping.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Fit:\u003c\/strong\u003e The deep-pocket fitted sheet includes an elastic band on all four sides, accommodating mattresses up to 14 inches thick for a secure fit.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Simply machine wash in cold water and tumble dry on low; designed to withstand years of use without weakening or tearing.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSelected Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features a fun Halloween theme with Pumpkin, Ghost, and Bats patterns.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Suitable for all seasons, including Fall, Summer, and Winter.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u0